{"id": "EUVD-2026-105085", "enisaUuid": "6bd31810-a518-3f46-b535-03043ccf498d", "description": "Configurable Reports block for Moodle before 5.3.0 contains an authorization bypass vulnerability that allows authenticated users to read restricted reports through the block_configurable_reports_get_report_data web service. When check_permissions fails, the function only adds a warning and still returns the full report table, letting any logged-in user supply arbitrary report ids to read SQL reports over user and grade data.", "datePublished": "2026-10-20T15:40:33", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-20T16:28:22", "baseScore": 7.1, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:H/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/jleyva/moodle-block_configurablereports/commit/4a0e6eadf7bdb6fa52ef71141bdf120cd68e6abc", "https://github.com/jleyva/moodle-block_configurablereports/releases/tag/5.3.0", "https://github.com/jleyva/moodle-block_configurablereports/blob/5.2.0/classes/external.php#L95-L99", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/configurable-reports-block-for-moodle-before-5.3.0-authorization-bypass-via-get-report-data"], "aliases": ["GHSA-7v7c-h53q-gqrm", "CVE-2026-113607"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.42, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "4c25ab28-f2d9-31c0-811b-0f1d4dfa089e", "product": {"name": "moodle-block_configurablereports", "vendor": {"name": "jleyva"}}, "product_version": "0 <5.3.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "158bb4b9-326c-352b-adad-030626b8309c", "vendor": {"name": "jleyva"}}], "isExploited": false}